OL,3,GNEWSA'We went from home baking to
OL,4,Awinning TV show'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo baker friends who started making
OL,7,Fcakes in their home kitchen have now
OL,8,Fwon an international TV competition.
OL,10,FDusica Roberts, from Burnham-on-Sea in
OL,11,FSomerset, and Verity Malinowska from
OL,12,FPlymouth, took part in the TV series
OL,13,FBake Master Battles, a show on the
OL,14,FCanadian Food Network.
OL,16,FThe pair said winning the
OL,17,FHalloween-themed episode, where they
OL,18,Fbaked a zombie cake sculpture, was a
OL,19,F"surreal" and "exciting" experience, as
OL,20,Ffirst reported by Burnham-on-Sea.com.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
