OL,3,GNEWSA'We went from home baking to
OL,4,Awinning TV show'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"As a child, you don't think, 'I'm
OL,7,Fgoing to make cakes when I'm older and
OL,8,Fgo on international television',"
OL,9,FRoberts said.
